paper_shaders

This package is a Flutter runtime shader port of Paper Shaders
(https://github.com/paper-design/shaders), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. Shader source, algorithms, presets,
the 128x128 noise texture asset, and image-processing resources
are derived from the original work.

This repository is a fork of
https://github.com/AndreFrelicot/paper-shaders-flutter (0.0.3),
modified by tech-ming. Changes are listed in CHANGELOG.md.

